# /srv/moa/env/clubs.env (optional): the club dashboard's run-time settings
# (repo moa_web, apps/clubs). Nothing is required today:
#   - MOA_API_URL is set by compose.yml (http://backend:8000);
#   - NEXT_PUBLIC_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID and the Sentry DSN are written into the
#     image when CI builds it (moa_web: deploy/build/<environment>.env).
# Anything added here applies with: sudo /srv/moa/deploy.sh recreate clubs
